NOTE ON THE .pending EXTENSION
  Deliberate: every discovery walker in this project keys on `.endsWith('.js')` or
  `.md` (prose lint, PREMISE check, pagination-guard discovery). A `.pending` file is
  inert to all of them, so parking work here cannot break a gate. Delete this file
  once the patches are applied and the suite is green.
